<title>UK: Rob't Fleming sets Hutchison Whampoa wrnts.</title>
<headline>Rob't Fleming sets Hutchison Whampoa wrnts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming &amp; Co Ltd says it has issued a total of 60 million American-style call warrants, on Hutchison Whampoa.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    44.20 HKD		 PREMIUM	10.08 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.985 HKD		 GEARING	5.0 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.OCT.96-16.JAN.98   PAYDATE	01.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG		 MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
